<P STYLE="margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 6.5pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"></P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="border-collapse: collapse; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0pt; width: 50%; text-align: justify; padding-bottom: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0pt; width: 1%; text-align: justify; padding-bottom: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0pt; width: 1%; text-align: justify; padding-bottom: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt">&#9679;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0pt; width: 48%; text-align: justify; padding-bottom: 0pt; padding-left: 5pt; text-indent: 0pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"> approximately $ million for the continued research and development of our Mudra technology, including the research and development of the Mudra XR wristband, and additional neural signals architecture, algorithms and user experience, or UX;</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0pt; text-align: justify; padding-bottom: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0pt; text-align: justify; padding-bottom: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0pt; text-align: justify; padding-bottom: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0pt; text-align: justify; padding-bottom: 0pt; padding-left: 5pt; text-indent: 0pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0pt; text-align: justify; padding-bottom: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0pt; text-align: justify; padding-bottom: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0pt; text-align: justify; padding-bottom: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt">&#9679;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0pt; text-align: justify; padding-bottom: 0pt; padding-left: 5pt; text-indent: 0pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"> approximately $ million for sales and support of our B2B customers, and for the integration and licensing our Mudra technology into our B2B customers&rsquo; products; and</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0pt; text-align: justify; padding-bottom: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0pt; text-align: justify; padding-bottom: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0pt; text-align: justify; padding-bottom: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0pt; text-align: justify; padding-bottom: 0pt; padding-left: 5pt; text-indent: 0pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0pt; padding-bottom: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0pt; padding-bottom: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0pt; padding-bottom: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt">&#9679;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify; padding-right: 0pt; padding-bottom: 0pt; padding-left: 5pt; text-indent: 0pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">the remainder for working
capital and general corporate purposes.</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0pt; padding-bottom: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0pt; padding-bottom: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0pt; padding-bottom: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0pt; padding-bottom: 0pt; padding-left: 5pt; text-indent: 0pt">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0pt; padding-bottom: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0pt; padding-bottom: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD COLSPAN="2" STYLE="text-align: justify; padding-right: 0pt; padding-bottom: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt">The amounts and schedule of our actual expenditures will depend on multiple factors. As a result, our management will have broad discretion in the application of the net proceeds of this offering. See &ldquo;Use of Proceeds&rdquo; on page S-12 of this prospectus supplement. &nbsp;</TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 6.5pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 6.5pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"></P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
