<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">The information above assumes
that the underwriter does not exercise its over-allotment option and the exercise of the pre-funded warrants. If the underwriter exercises
its over-allotment option to purchase additional Ordinary Shares in full in this offering, the number of Ordinary Shares held by new investors
