Shares held by existing shareholders will decrease to % of the total Ordinary Shares issued and outstanding.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in; background-color: white"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">The
above discussion and table are based on 15,942,984 Ordinary Shares outstanding as of June 30, 2023. This number excludes:</FONT></P>

